<section id="planning-variants" class="divider evidence-section">
  <div class="section-label"><p class="eyebrow">Length &amp; Cost Options</p><h2>Canonical plan and documented alternatives</h2><p>The checked-in itinerary remains the baseline. Shorter options are additive and never overwrite it.</p></div>
  <div class="variant-grid">{%- for variant in trip.variants.variants -%}<article{% if variant.canonical %} class="canonical"{% endif %}><span>{% if variant.canonical %}Canonical baseline{% else %}Alternative{% endif %}</span><h3>{{ variant.label }}</h3><p><strong>{{ variant.nights }} nights · {{ variant.ptoDays }} PTO</strong><br>{{ variant.budget.lowUsd | moneyK }}&ndash;{{ variant.budget.highUsd | moneyK }} · {{ variant.budget.distribution | replace("-", " ") }}</p><p>{{ variant.notes }}</p><small>{{ variant.claimType | default("derived") | replace("-", " ") | title }} · {{ variant.confidence | default("unknown") | title }} confidence</small>{% if variant.removedExperiences.length %}<small>Tradeoff: {{ variant.removedExperiences | join("; ") }}</small>{% endif %}</article>{%- endfor -%}</div>
  {%- if trip.variants.variants | length == 1 %}<p class="variant-note">No shorter route is presented yet because its savings and lost experiences have not been reconciled. The option remains open for future research.</p>{% endif %}
</section>
